                {
                    "id": 142661,
                    "date": "2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z",
                    "time": "10:00",
                    "title": "%3Cstrong%3ETbilisi%20City%20tour%3C/strong%3E%0A",
                    "title_search": "Tbilisi City tour",
                    "sites_id": 172,
                    "content": "Begin your Tbilisi adventure at the impressive <strong>Holy Trinity Cathedral, </strong>or Sameba Cathedral, the tallest church in Georgia, standing at 101 meters. Next, delve into the charm of the old city, starting with <strong>Abanotubani</strong>, renowned for its ancient sulfur baths. Here,  <strong>Mtkvari River. </strong>Enjoy a scenic cable car ride to or from this historic site. Nearby, see <strong>Kartlis Deda,</strong> the iconic 20-meter aluminum statue symbolizing the city. Cross to the other side of the river to explore Metekhi, a historic neighborhood perched on a cliff above the <strong>Mtkvari River. </strong>Stroll through <strong>Rike Park</strong>, a modern green space that leads to the famous <strong>Bridge of Peace,</strong> a striking bow-shaped pedestrian bridge made of steel and glass, illuminated by numerous LEDs.\n",
                    "remarks": "Narikala%20Cable%20car%20ticket%20(Included)%0A",
