                {
                    "id": 142662,
                    "date": "2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z",
                    "time": "16:00",
                    "title": "%3Cstrong%3EDiscover%20the%20Historic%20Wonders%20of%20Mtskheta%3C/strong%3E%0A",
                    "title_search": "Discover the Historic Wonders of Mtskheta",
                    "sites_id": 257,
                    "content": "Discover the ancient charm of Mtskheta, one of Georgia's oldest and most historically significant cities, on this captivating tour. As the former capital of the Kingdom of Iberia and a UNESCO World Heritage site, Mtskheta is rich in religious and cultural heritage. The tour includes visits to iconic landmarks such as the 6th-century Jvari Monastery, perched on a hilltop with panoramic views, and the impressive Svetitskhoveli Cathedral, a masterpiece of medieval Georgian architecture and a revered spiritual site. Wander through the quaint streets, explore historic churches, and soak in the timeless atmosphere of this sacred city, where Georgia’s Christian history began. This tour offers an unforgettable journey into the heart of Georgia's spiritual and cultural legacy.\n",
                    "remarks": "",
