                    "date": "2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z",
                    "time": "09:00",
                    "title": "%3Cstrong%3EDay%20Trip:%20Explore%20the%20Scenic%20Wonders%20of%20Ananuri%20Fortress,%20Gudauri%20&amp;%20Kazbegi%3C/strong%3E%0A",
                    "title_search": "Day Trip: Explore the Scenic Wonders of Ananuri Fortress, Gudauri & Kazbegi",
                    "sites_id": 218,
                    "content": "Embark on a breathtaking journey along the Georgian Military Road, where stunning landscapes and historic landmarks await. Marvel at the beauty of <strong>Zhinvali Reservoir</strong>, a picturesque water body, and explore the <strong>Ananuri Fortress</strong>, a medieval stronghold rich in history. Witness the panoramic views from the <strong>Arch of Friendship</strong> near Gudauri, perched on a 600-meter cliff. Finally, visit the charming town of <strong>Stepantsminda</strong> and the iconic <strong>Gergety Trinity Church</strong>, standing at 2,170 meters beneath the majestic Mount Kazbegi. This unforgettable adventure promises awe-inspiring scenery and cultural treasures at every turn!\n",
                    "remarks": "160%20km%20/%203%20hr%20(One%20way)%3Cbr%20/%3E%0A%3Cbr%20/%3E%0A4X4%20Jeep%20in%20Kazbegi%20(included)&nbsp;%0A%0A&nbsp;%0A",
