                    "title": "%3Cstrong%3EJourney%20Back:%20From%20Kazbegi%20to%20Tbilisi%3C/strong%3E%0A",
                    "title_search": "Journey Back: From Kazbegi to Tbilisi",
                    "sites_id": 228,
                    "content": "Wind your way back to Tbilisi from Kazbegi, driving through the majestic landscapes of the Georgian Military Highway. Begin your return journey at Kazbegi, where the dramatic Gergeti Trinity Church, set against Mount Kazbek, offers a spiritual pause. Drive southward to Gudauri, where the expansive vistas across the Caucasus serve as a visual feast. Continue past the historic Ananuri fortress, where tales of ancient battles and architectural beauty linger by the shores of the serene Jinvali Water Reservoir. As you meander through mountain passes and verdant valleys, each curve of the road brings you closer to the bustling energy of Tbilisi, concluding a journey of picturesque views and cultural richness.\n",
