                    "title": "%3Cstrong%3EFull%20Day%20Excursion%20to%20Kakheti:%20Sighnaghi%20&amp;%20Bodbe%20(From%20Tbilisi)%3C/strong%3E%0A",
                    "title_search": "Full Day Excursion to Kakheti: Sighnaghi & Bodbe (From Tbilisi)",
                    "sites_id": 176,
                    "content": "Starting with the serene Bodbe Monastery, the final resting place of St. Nino, continue to the charming \"City of Love,\" Sighnaghi, with its cobblestone streets and panoramic views of the Alazani Valley and the Caucasus Mountains. Experience Kakheti's famed wine culture with a visit to a local winery for wine tasting and insights into traditional winemaking techniques.  This tour combines spiritual tranquility, cultural exploration, and delightful wine tasting, making it an unforgettable journey.\n\n \n",
